    web_render_4x_run_phase_glyph_raster_cost_2026-11-28, P3, open, "web render: Chrome-matching run start phases at k=4 cost ~3% CPU on catalog html (suspected first-use quarter-phase glyph cells)", src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/text_layout/font_renderer.spl, 501, "PAGE_DEVICE_SCALE=4 SIMPLE_EXECUTION_MODE=interpreter SIMPLE_2D_BACKEND=cpu_simd simple run examples/06_io/ui/web_render_page_ppm.spl examples/06_io/ui/web_catalog/html.html out.ppm 900 760, alternating A/B vs base", 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

